OL,3,GNEWSACouncil tax bills in Wandsworth
OL,4,Acould almost double
OL,5,
OL,6,FWandsworth Council could raise council
OL,7,Ftax by #958 for a Band D property, an
OL,8,Fincrease of 94%, under proposals
OL,9,Fdescribed as "outrageous".
OL,11,FThe Conservative-led London borough
OL,12,Fsaid the rise was needed unless the
OL,13,Fgovernment reconsidered cuts to its
OL,14,Ffunding. Under changes, announced
OL,15,Fearlier this year, the council said it
OL,16,Fstood to lose #84m a year in funding by
OL,17,Fthe end of the next three years.
OL,19,FPlans to increase the council tax were
OL,20,Fheard at an extraordinary council
OL,21,Fmeeting on Tuesday but a final decision
OL,22,Fwill not be made until early next year.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
